  "hadithNarratorSummaryAbuHurairah": "Abu Hurairah was a Companion of the Prophet ﷺ known for staying close to the Messenger of Allah ﷺ and transmitting a large number of hadith. In this library, he appears often in narrations about worship, character, repentance, and daily Muslim life.",
