  "hadithNarratorSummaryAbdullahIbnUmar": "Abdullah ibn Umar was a Companion known for his careful following of the Sunnah and his devotion to worship. His narrations in this library often center on prayer, travel, restraint, and living with awareness of the Hereafter.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAnasIbnMalik": "Anas ibn Malik served the Prophet ﷺ in Madinah and transmitted many hadith about the Prophet''s conduct, mercy, and daily example. In this library, his narrations often carry practical guidance rooted in close companionship and service.",
