  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "Akhirah & Accountability Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "A balanced path through judgment, deeds, resurrection, urgency, and hope in the Hereafter.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionAkhirahAccountabilityStarter": "Let each ayah move you toward preparation, not fear alone: deeds, honesty, urgency, and hope all belong here.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathTitleProphetsLessonsStarter": "Prophets & Lessons Starter",
  "quranAyahInsightPathDescriptionProphetsLessonsStarter": "A focused path through prophetic patience, reliance, submission, da''wah, and just leadership.",
  "quranAyahInsightPathReflectionProphetsLessonsStarter": "Watch how prophetic examples turn abstract values into lived responses under trial, calling, and responsibility.",
