  "quranSurahInsightDescriptionAlBaqarah": "A surah of guidance, worship, covenant, and patient trust, teaching how belief becomes a lived community ethic.",
  "quranSurahInsightDescriptionAliImran": "A surah that joins belief, reflection, restraint, and steadfastness, especially when the heart is tested.",
  "quranSurahInsightDescriptionTaHa": "A surah that keeps revelation close to worship, remembrance, and humble seeking of knowledge.",
  "quranSurahInsightDescriptionAlFurqan": "A surah of discernment that contrasts empty rejection with the quiet conduct of the servants of the Most Merciful.",
  "quranSurahInsightDescriptionLuqman": "A surah that joins wisdom, gratitude, Tawhid, family counsel, and humble conduct in one moral frame.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersAlBaqarah": "Al-Baqarah teaches that guidance is not abstract. It shapes worship, covenant, patience, and the way a believing community responds to trials and mercy.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersAliImran": "Ali 'Imran matters because it trains belief under pressure. It joins reflection on Allah's signs with restraint, mercy, and steadiness when the heart is tested.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersTaHa": "Ta-Ha matters because it keeps revelation close to worship and remembrance. It teaches that knowledge, prayer, and humility belong together in the life of faith.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersAlFurqan": "Al-Furqan matters because it distinguishes truth from noise through conduct. It shows that the servants of the Most Merciful are known by humility, discernment, and remembrance.",
  "quranSurahInsightWhyItMattersLuqman": "Luqman matters because it joins Tawhid, gratitude, family counsel, and character in one frame. It teaches that wisdom is seen in worship, advice, and humble conduct.",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeGuidanceAndDevotion": "Guidance and devotion",
  "quranSurahInsightThemePatienceAndReliance": "Patience and reliance",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeSupplicationAndResponse": "Supplication and response",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeSteadfastBelief": "Steadfast belief",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeCharacterUnderPressure": "Character under pressure",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeReflectingOnSigns": "Reflecting on signs",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeRevelationAndRemembrance": "Revelation and remembrance",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeSeekingKnowledge": "Seeking knowledge",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeWorshipWithPresence": "Worship with presence",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeDiscernmentAndReflection": "Discernment and reflection",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeHumbleServanthood": "Humble servanthood",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeSignsInTimeAndCreation": "Signs in time and creation",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeGratitudeAndWisdom": "Gratitude and wisdom",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeTawhidInFamilyGuidance": "Tawhid in family guidance",
  "quranSurahInsightThemeHumilityAndGoodConduct": "Humility and good conduct",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonSteadfastWorshipNeedsHelp": "Steadfast worship is not self-powered; it asks Allah for help and keeps returning to Him.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonRememberingAllahReshapesTheHeart": "Remembering Allah is not decorative spirituality; it reforms the heart and steadies the believer.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonDuaIsPartOfLivedFaith": "Du''a belongs inside faith and worship, not outside them, because nearness to Allah should produce calling upon Him.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonTaqwaAndReflectionBelongTogether": "Taqwa deepens when the believer reflects on signs instead of passing over them distracted.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonMercyAndRestraintAreStrengths": "Mercy, self-restraint, and gentleness are strengths that preserve a believing community under strain.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonSteadfastnessBuiltThroughBeliefAndCharacter": "Steadfastness grows from sound belief together with disciplined character, not from emotion alone.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonPrayerKeepsRevelationConnectedToLife": "Prayer keeps revelation connected to daily life by turning remembrance into a repeated act of devotion.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonSincereLearningBeginsWithHumility": "Seeking knowledge begins with humility before Allah, not with self-satisfaction.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonRemembranceShapesAction": "Remembrance is meant to shape what a person does, not merely what a person feels for a moment.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonServantsOfMercifulKnownByConduct": "The servants of the Most Merciful are recognized by steady conduct before they are recognized by claims.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonSignsLeadToRemembrance": "Signs in creation are meant to awaken remembrance, gratitude, and moral clarity.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonGuidanceVisibleInConduct": "Guidance becomes visible in how a person walks, speaks, and answers harm with dignity.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonGratitudeIsWorship": "Gratitude is a form of worship that acknowledges Allah''s favor with the heart, tongue, and life.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonBeliefAndCharacterTogether": "Belief and character are taught together because Tawhid should shape counsel, family life, and conduct.",
  "quranSurahInsightLessonWisdomShowsInHumility": "Wisdom appears in humility before Allah and in refusing arrogance toward people.",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAlBaqarahWorshipAndHelp": "How does this surah connect worship to seeking Allah''s help when effort feels heavy?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAlBaqarahDuaAndResponse": "Which ayahs in this surah teach that nearness to Allah should lead naturally to du''a and trust?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAliImranPressureAndCharacter": "What kind of character does this surah ask for when a believing community faces pressure or disappointment?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAliImranSignsAndBelief": "How do the signs named in this surah deepen belief instead of remaining only information?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptTaHaRevelationAndPresence": "How does Ta-Ha keep revelation connected to prayer, remembrance, and presence before Allah?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptTaHaKnowledgeAndHumility": "Which moments in this surah show that sincere learning begins with humility rather than self-assurance?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAlFurqanConductAndDiscernment": "How does this surah define discernment through conduct, speech, and the refusal to answer ignorance with more ignorance?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptAlFurqanTimeAndSigns": "What signs in time and creation does this surah name, and how should they reshape remembrance and gratitude?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptLuqmanFamilyAndTawhid": "How does Luqman teach Tawhid through family counsel rather than through abstract doctrine alone?",
  "quranSurahInsightPromptLuqmanGratitudeAndHumility": "Where does this surah connect gratitude, humble conduct, and wise speech as one way of living before Allah?",
