  "learningJourneyStageSalahPrepareTitle": "Prepare for prayer",
  "learningJourneyStageSalahPrepareSummary": "Learn how wudu, intention, timing, and calm prepare the heart and body for salah.",
  "learningJourneyStageSalahMovementsTitle": "Movements of salah",
